-- title:
--   Simultaneous growth bounds with a zero-indexed comparison sequence
-- statement:
--   Let $D,g,H:\mathbb N\to\mathbb R$, with $H_0=1$, $g_1\ge1$, $D_1\ge1$, and $H_{n+1}=(1+1/(3(n+1)))H_n$. Suppose for every integer $n\ge1$ that
--   \[
--   D_n\le\frac{3n-1}{2}g_n,\qquad D_n+g_n+g_{n+1}\le D_{n+1}.
--   \]
--   Then for every $n\ge0$,
--   \[
--   H_n\le g_{n+1},\qquad \frac{3(n+1)-1}{2}H_n\le D_{n+1}.
--   \]
--   This induction compares the slopes and diagonal values with the same explicit product sequence.
